OL,3,GNEWSAHeroin dealing 75-year-old has
OL,4,A#80,000 worth of assets confiscated
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 75-year-old drug dealer has had more
OL,7,Fthan #80,000 worth of his assets
OL,8,Fconfiscated.
OL,10,FArthur Hughes, of Maes Bleddyn, Rachub,
OL,11,FGwynedd, was given a 38-month prison
OL,12,Fsentence in June for possession of
OL,13,Fheroin with intent to supply and
OL,14,Fpossession of criminal property.
OL,16,FOn 12 October at Caernarfon Crown
OL,17,FCourt, the full value of Hughes' crimes
OL,18,Fwas estimated to be more than #151,730,
OL,19,FNorth Wales Police said.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
